cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  RAISR-SME: Auditable Cyber-AI Triage and the Limits of Breach-Based Validation
message: >-
  If you use the RAISR-SME instrument, item bank, or empirical and simulation
  replication suite, please cite this software package and the accompanying
  ICIIT 2027 manuscript.
type: software
